<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">OUR TABLE / 一起相聚</view><view wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}"><view class="title">朋友留了张桌。</view><view class="notice">微信登录后查看邀请并确认报名。不会自动取得日常点餐权限。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="signIn" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">微信登录，查看聚会</button></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在查看聚会…</view><block wx:if="{{loggedIn && party}}"><image class="party-cover" src="{{coverImage}}" mode="aspectFit" binderror="coverError"/><view class="badge">{{statusText}}</view><view class="detail-theme">{{party.theme}}</view><view class="section"><view>{{party.location}}</view><view class="notice">{{startText}} 至 {{endText}} · 北京时间</view><view class="muted">计划时间不会自动结束聚会。</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{firstEndText}}">首次结束于 {{firstEndText}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{party.canJoin}}" class="primary" bindtap="join" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}" loading="{{busy}}">确认报名 · 计1人</button><view class="notice" wx:if="{{!party.membership && party.status==='ENDED'}}">聚会已结束，创建者重开后可接受报名。</view><block wx:if="{{party.membership}}"><view class="subtitle">成员 {{party.memberCount}} 人</view><view class="member" wx:for="{{party.members}}" wx:key="userId"><text>{{item.name}}</text><view class="member-actions"><button wx:if="{{item.canRemove}}" class="member-remove" data-id="{{item.userId}}" bindtap="removeMember" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">移除</button><text class="muted">{{item.status==='JOINED'?'已报名':item.status==='EXITED'?'已退出':'已移除'}}</text></view></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{party.membership!=='JOINED'}}">你已退出或被移除，可回看记录；通过有效邀请可重新报名。</view><view class="section"><view class="subtitle">采购清单</view><view class="muted">一起添物品、认领采购，已购费用自动汇总。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="purchases" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">采购清单与费用 ›</button></view><button class="primary" open-type="share" wx:if="{{canShare}}" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">邀请朋友一起吃饭</button><view class="error" wx:if="{{shareError}}">{{shareError}}</view><view class="actions" wx:if="{{party.creator}}"><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{party.canEdit}}" bindtap="edit" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">修改聚会信息</button><button class="secondary" data-action="END" bindtap="change" wx:if="{{party.status==='ACTIVE'}}" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">结束聚会</button><button class="secondary" data-action="REOPEN" bindtap="change" wx:else disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">重开补充</button><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{party.status==='ACTIVE'}}" data-action="DISABLE_INVITATION" bindtap="change" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">停用邀请</button><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{party.status==='ACTIVE'}}" data-action="REGENERATE_INVITATION" bindtap="change" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">重新生成邀请</button></view><button class="danger" wx:if="{{!party.creator && party.membership==='JOINED' && party.status==='ACTIVE'}}" data-action="EXIT" bindtap="change" disabled="{{busy || retryPending}}">退出聚会</button></block></block><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button wx:if="{{retryPending}}" class="primary" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy}}">核对上次操作</button><button wx:elif="{{loggedIn && !loading}}" class="secondary" bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新聚会</button><view class="link" bindtap="records">我参加的聚会 ›</view><view class="link" wx:if="{{party && !party.dailyAllowed}}" bindtap="mine">个人资料 ›</view></view>